// Single compiler-facing version owner. This source is a development build:
// لا_شيء, whose status the driver prints in the selected language (iSpeak
// حالة_إصدار_تطويري). A release build replaces this module with one that
// returns its version: CMake's SULTANC_RELEASE_VERSION (./build.sh
// --release-version=VERSION) writes it and binds compiler.version to it with
// --module-source (cmake/CMakeLists.txt), as the LLVM capability is bound.
// Stage0 always compiles this source.
عام عرف إصدار_السلطان(): اختياري نص {
    أرجع اختياري.لا_شيء();
}
